Chapter: HalPeripheralLeak
  cites Foreword chapter Board

 A peripheral handle that is never closed is a leak: the bus is left
 configured and clocked with nobody owning it. The handle is linear, so
 dropping it is CDX2063.

 This is the claim Board.codex used to make in prose and not keep.

Section: Body
  leak : Integer -> [Device.Mmio] Integer
  leak (base) = act
    p <- uart-open base default-uart-config
    mmio-read-32 base
  end

  opening : Text = "leak"
